{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"f61e88b5e2bca13989893ef5b924fbc81661d19af3d579f54339d04a0a388eb0"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:1e6fa9d66a26a6e4328cf23af85ea9902c648443fc27da0abf4e29b57d1b60f4","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"Around mid-July 2023","evidence":"[D8:9 | 1:51 pm on 15 July, 2023] Caroline: That photo is stunning! So glad you bonded over our love of nature. Last Friday I went to a council meeting for adoption. It was inspiring and emotional - so many people wanted to create loving homes for children in need. It made me even more determined to adopt.","itemId":"urn:uuid:ffe11250-2e83-5138-b47f-6ee4ce0554f8","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:437dc9fa46e8f4e95b556406f5d716f2d207596e33bda2f371f51f89e9211170","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"When did Caroline go to the adoption meeting?","referenceAnswer":"The friday before 15 July 2023","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"437dc9fa46e8f4e95b556406f5d716f2d207596e33bda2f371f51f89e9211170"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}